OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fmountain snow clear eastwards, leaving
OL,7,Fscattered blustery showers in the
OL,8,Fwest, locally heavy with a small
OL,9,Fchance of thunder near coasts. Gales
OL,10,Fin the far northeast soon ease.
